  "notes": "Anime Breaker is a clicker and card-collecting game set across several anime-themed worlds. You tap to build energy, which makes you stronger, then fight enemies to earn resources and rare drops. Opening cards gives you companions that fight next to you, and you unlock avatars and weapons as you rank up and upgrade. Later on you take on raids and harder worlds, and the Crews update is the latest big patch.\n\nNearly every code gives Emeralds, the premium currency, usually 200 or 250 at a time, and a few add potions or Currency Boxes. Emeralds matter most because they are slow to earn by playing. Save your potions for a raid or a fresh world so the boosts count. New codes arrive at milestones for visits, favorites and players online (CCU), plus one with each named update like NEWHARBOR and NEWINVASION.",
