    {
      "q": "Why can't I find the code box in Anime Breaker?",
      "a": "You need to finish the short opening tutorial first. Turn on auto-click, beat your first enemy, then open the Shop and click the ticket icon in its bottom left corner."
    },
    {
      "q": "What does CCU mean in codes like 16KCCU?",
      "a": "CCU means concurrent users, the number of people playing at the same time. The developers release a code each time the game hits a new player-count record."
    },
    {
      "q": "Do Anime Breaker codes need capital letters?",
      "a": "Type them in capitals exactly as listed. Every current code is uppercase letters and numbers with no spaces, so copying and pasting is the safest way."
    }
